<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Tradehold 16-mo post-exeps earnings dip.</title>
<headline>Tradehold 16-mo post-exeps earnings dip.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sixteen mo to June 30.</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>Shr, attrib (cts)</p>
<p>    - before exceptional items     391.2   vs   249.0 *</p>
<p>    - after exceptional items	 83.5   vs   198.5</p>
<p>    Pre-tax				128.32  vs    86.35</p>
<p>    Tax				     83.28  vs     6.44</p>
<p>    Net profit			    22.74  vs    53.37</p>
<p>    Turnover			  10,183.26  vs 6,363.64</p>
<p>    Extraordinary items		110.04  vs    13.39</p>
<p>* 12 months to February 28 1995.</p>
<p>Full name:  Tradehold Ltd</p>
<p>NOTE - A capitalisation share award was made in May 1996 amounting to an equivalent of 42 cents per share. No additional award is recommended for the period under review.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
